; The overlay's. A directory of its own for the reason test/ppx/ has one: dune's
; check context is per directory, and a stanza whose (libraries) differ from its
; neighbours' gets the neighbours' under `dune build @check`.
;
; It links camlcast_loom directly. What these suites drive is a Trace feed and a
; row of hook slots, which are loom's own vocabulary; camlcast re-exports only
; the part of it a game writes descriptions with.

